{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4849768","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年法国初体验","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"记录法国之行中一连串难忘的“第一次”：从屋顶会议、参观展会到抓到呆呆兽和见证足球狂欢。","date":"2016-07-09","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 初めて！","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 初めて！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4849768.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160711140335id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4849768.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4849768/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/001-743bae6e55.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录法国之行中一连串难忘的“第一次”：从屋顶会议、参观展会到抓到呆呆兽和见证足球狂欢。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这次的法国</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">又是满满的第一次经历</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/001-743bae6e55.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/001-743bae6e55.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n在令人心情舒畅的酒店屋顶开会，还是第一次（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/002-eb645f216e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/002-eb645f216e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n在这个地方拍摄，还是第一次！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/003-56cd117530.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/003-56cd117530.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n在埃菲尔铁塔用宝可梦 GO 抓到呆呆兽，也是第一次！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/004-233680640a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/004-233680640a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n第一次！在小城堡里享用晚餐！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/005-a5d6f41479.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/005-a5d6f41479.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n第一次！登上 Japan Expo 的舞台！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/006-efc0bcd65e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/006-efc0bcd65e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>第一次！参观 Japan Expo！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/007-c2c0f21750.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/007-c2c0f21750.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n在第一次去的店里吃了海鲜拼盘！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/008-373fc2d0c1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/008-373fc2d0c1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还有因 EURO2016 半决赛获胜而沸腾的人们！\n\n爆竹和汽车喇叭一个劲儿地响，确实挺吵的（笑）\n\n第一次看到法国人因为足球如此兴奋！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/009-883b2fb903.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/009-883b2fb903.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n爬啊爬啊爬上螺旋楼梯之后……\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/010-7a9b4d757e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/010-7a9b4d757e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n第一次登上凯旋门！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n↑点击进入视频！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好多好多的\n第一次经历\n就这样与我相遇，\n度过了美好时光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家也\n去找找看\n“第一次！”吧！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n其实你会发现，\n这样的经历\n意外地多！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回のフランス</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">これまた初めてのことばかり</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/001-743bae6e55.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/001-743bae6e55.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n気持ちの良いホテルの屋上での打ち合わせは初（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/002-eb645f216e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/002-eb645f216e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\nこの場所での撮影は初！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/003-56cd117530.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/003-56cd117530.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\nPokémon GO エッフェル塔でヤドン捕まえたのも初！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/004-233680640a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/004-233680640a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n初！小さなお城でディナー！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/005-a5d6f41479.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/005-a5d6f41479.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n初！Japan Expo! で登壇！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/006-efc0bcd65e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/006-efc0bcd65e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>初！Japan Expo 見学！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/007-c2c0f21750.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/007-c2c0f21750.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n初めて行ったお店でFruits de mer !\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/008-373fc2d0c1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/008-373fc2d0c1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nそしてEURO2016 準決勝の勝利に沸く人たち！\n\n爆竹と車のクラクション鳴らしまくりはうるさかったけど（笑）\n\nサッカーでこんなに盛り上がるフランス人を見たのは初！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/009-883b2fb903.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/009-883b2fb903.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n螺旋階段を登りまくると・・\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/010-7a9b4d757e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4849768/010-7a9b4d757e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n凱旋門に登ったのは初！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n↑クリックで動画へ！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nたくさんの\n初めてに\n出会って\n良い時間を過ごしました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみなさんも\n「初！」\n探してみて下さい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n実は意外と多いことに\n気付きます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}